{"at": "2026-09-09T07:31:25Z", "data": {"blocking": false, "detail": "evals/cases/golden_cases.json treats explicitly supplied ACARA ID 99999 as requiring no directory lookup and permits an empty success. contract/POC_CONTRACT_V0.3_SPEC.md classifies an ID absent from the pinned directory as bad_request. The two cannot both be satisfied by pre-dispatch directory-membership validation. This work item is bounded around the conflict rather than resolving it (contract requirement direct-id-authority-conflict, and the matching out_of_scope entry), so it is advisory here. It becomes blocking for any work item that enforces directory membership for caller-supplied IDs, and the Definition Pack owner must rule before then.", "id": "C1", "opened_at": "2026-09-09T07:31:25Z", "origin_stage": "planning", "raised_by": "planner", "references": ["planning/001-plan.md", "acceptance/002-contract.yaml", "contract/POC_CONTRACT_V0.3_SPEC.md", "evals/cases/golden_cases.json"], "resolution": null, "resolved_at": null, "status": "open", "summary": "golden_cases.json and the v0.3 specification disagree on an explicitly supplied ACARA ID that is absent from the pinned directory"}, "previous_sha256": "bacc709926a6621506f563e85c85d4f7bfa0f0dbb7b7537d093f6b3b06f1f6bc", "seq": 41, "sha256": "126bbd5a2d19e6c9885dda2b2b40e37f64507c216aecf51c5f45d84fc5c87069", "source": {"method_commit": "f99ea0d8e2b6bee47f87b4336673662d5bc09db9", "method_dirty": true, "tool": "coding-harness", "tool_version": "0.2.0"}, "type": "human.concern-opened"}
{"at": "2026-09-09T07:31:25Z", "data": {"blocking": false, "detail": "Only VC-POC-01, VC-POC-03 and VC-POC-04 request schemas are captured, so generic local JSON Schema validation cannot be applied to every registered question. The plan limits exact schema assertions to those three and the contract puts the rest out of scope. Adding the remaining request schemas to the Definition Pack is the precondition for full pre-dispatch validation.", "id": "C2", "opened_at": "2026-09-09T07:31:25Z", "origin_stage": "planning", "raised_by": "planner", "references": ["planning/001-plan.md", "contract/question_schemas/v0.3.0/_index.json"], "resolution": null, "resolved_at": null, "status": "open", "summary": "the Definition Pack supplies request schemas for only three of the registered questions"}, "previous_sha256": "126bbd5a2d19e6c9885dda2b2b40e37f64507c216aecf51c5f45d84fc5c87069", "seq": 42, "sha256": "28a1d6dcf82f1c40e410e776f6278312080d5779da199da32596436b37a4e4fb", "source": {"method_commit": "f99ea0d8e2b6bee47f87b4336673662d5bc09db9", "method_dirty": true, "tool": "coding-harness", "tool_version": "0.2.0"}, "type": "human.concern-opened"}
